; RV32IMF for Machine IR: register views and the ILP32F contract, the admitted
; selected forms with their semantics and constraints, and selection from
; generic Machine IR. A generic program's pointers become 32-bit registers and
; its i64 values pairs of them. Interpretable on any host; execution is under
; qemu-riscv32 through lib/machine_rivet_riscv32. Semantics cite the RISC-V
; unprivileged ISA, never assembler acceptance. See the Machine IR design in
; .ai/.

(library
 (name machine_target_riscv32)
 (libraries core err_trace expr fmt machine_interp machine_ir))
